      "width": 340,
      "height": 151.2,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "Redis DOWN \u2014 cache read errors\n\nlive read \u2192 DEGRADE:\n recompute from Postgres, serve\n (osctf_scoreboard_degraded_served_total)\n\nfrozen & !admin \u2192 FAIL CLOSED\n (frozen snapshot is Redis-only \u2014\n  no Postgres authority)\n\nsame outage, two behaviours \u2014 by design",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r_rdown2",
      "originalText": "Redis DOWN \u2014 cache read errors\n\nlive read \u2192 DEGRADE:\n recompute from Postgres, serve\n (osctf_scoreboard_degraded_served_total)\n\nfrozen & !admin \u2192 FAIL CLOSED\n (frozen snapshot is Redis-only \u2014\n  no Postgres authority)\n\nsame outage, two behaviours \u2014 by design",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
